      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability — cleaner structure, more descriptive assertion messages, removal of unused imports/fields, and clarifying comments.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes unused imports (`assertFalse`, `assertTrue`, `fail`, `EOFException`) and the unused `MARK_RESET_NOT_SUPPORTED` constant, adds a Javadoc on the `TestNullReader` explaining its character-indexing contract, and expands inline comments and assertion messages to clearly narrate each phase of the skip test (normal skip, partial skip at boundary, EOF return, and post-EOF exception)."
    }
